        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "perf(mapper): lazily evaluate Node.js project discovery in MapperContext",
        "body": "\r\n## What was changed\r\n\r\nResolved an architectural issue where Node.js workspace discovery (`discoverNodeProjects`) and Turbo task graph generation (`turboTaskGraph`) were executed eagerly for **all repositories**, including pure Go, Python, and other non-Node projects.\r\n\r\nThis caused unnecessary filesystem traversal and disk I/O even when no Node-specific mapper required the data.\r\n\r\nTo address this, `MapperContext` now exposes these values through **lazy, memoized async getters**, ensuring the expensive discovery logic executes only when first requested while preserving shared concurrency.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Core Changes\r\n\r\n### Lazy `MapperContext`\r\n\r\nUpdated `MapperContext` in `types.ts` to expose:\r\n\r\n* `projects(): Promise<NodeProjectInfo[]>`\r\n* `taskGraph(): Promise<WorkspaceTaskGraph>`\r\n\r\nUpdated `collectSeeds` in `mapper.ts` to:\r\n\r\n* Lazily initialize project discovery.\r\n* Memoize the resulting promises using `cachedProjects` and `cachedTaskGraph`.\r\n* Ensure the expensive discovery logic executes only once and is shared across all consumers.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Node Mapper Updates\r\n\r\nUpdated the following Node ecosystem mappers to await the lazy context:\r\n\r\n* `node.ts`\r\n* `next.ts`\r\n* `react.ts`\r\n* `node-routes.ts`\r\n\r\nThis preserves the existing behavior for Node repositories while avoiding unnecessary initialization for repositories that never require Node project discovery.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Test Validation\r\n\r\nUpdated the regression test in `mapper.test.ts`:\r\n\r\n* Converted the existing `it.fails(...)` test into a standard passing `it(...)` test.\r\n* Verified that `discoverNodeProjects` is **not** executed for Go/non-Node repositories.\r\n* Confirmed that Node project discovery still executes correctly when required by a Node-specific mapper.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n* ✅ All existing tests pass.\r\n* ✅ Regression test validates that non-Node repositories no longer trigger `discoverNodeProjects`.\r\n* ✅ Verified that Node ecosystem mappers continue to function correctly with the lazy context.\r\n\r\nFixes #155",
        "branch": "perf/lazy-node-discovery",
